# Create Ticket from Tickets Tab E2E Flow
> Create tickets directly from the channel's Tickets tab kanban view, with and without an attachment.

## Admin creates ticket from tickets tab
* Setting up ticket test with user "user-2" in channel "channel-1" for admin "admin-1"
* Creating ticket "ticket-tab-1" from tickets tab for user "admin-1" with priority "Medium"

## Admin creates ticket from tickets tab with an attachment
* Setting up ticket test in channel "channel-1" for admin "admin-1"
* Creating ticket "ticket-tab-attach-1" from tickets tab with attachment for user "admin-1" with priority "Medium"
